  "origin_checked_at": "2026-09-23T01:54:16",
  "origin_status": "原文已核",
  "origin_url": "https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/2024/issue_11766/202412/content_6993322.html",
  "origin_title": "国务院关于《兰州市国土空间总体规划（2021—2035年）》的批复",
  "origin_source": "国务院政策文件库（国家级官方）",
